<title>UK: LB Sachsen sets 1.0 billion mark four-year bond.</title>
<headline>LB Sachsen sets 1.0 billion mark four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Commerzbank, DG Bank, Dresdner Bank and Helaba.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK SACHSEN</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.25	MATURITY    02.OCT.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.335    PAY DATE  L-01.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  22.5 BP   REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES    L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    STUTT     PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    6 BP	SELL CONC  16.5 BP   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBREIF REIHE NO 70</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
